  "title": "SIP2.24: Add 14 Arks to LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet",
  "description": "# SIP2.24: Add 14 Arks to LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet\n\n## Summary\nThis is a cross-chain governance proposal to add 14 new Ark(s) to the existing LazyVault_HigherRisk_USDC Fleet on mainnet.\n\n## Motivation\nExpanding this fleet with additional Arks will enhance the protocol's capabilities on mainnet.\n\n## Technical Details\n- Hub Chain: base (Production)\n- Target Chain: mainnet\n- Fleet Commander: 0xE9cDA459bED6dcfb8AC61CD8cE08E2D52370cB06\n- Number of Arks to add: 14\n\n## New Ark Addresses\n1. `0xA6Fb46b115aE21E19475D8eE58C2F3E08b23C84C`\n2. `0xE0212eBbBFfadE416C5DaBAEA2Ea6c7a921c950F`\n3. `0xe399C348b679fD111B51f3f4D3c1159701df76a8`\n4. `0x59c6282f9797Eeb3C8622243595303f80131039A`\n5. `0x43AA3980D07C3343a815202Cf400D5027b0Bcb59`\n6. `0x2B8078ED8b642dc3BF8691C4d1493822f4917524`\n7. `0x8929cb46Cea5F9bC71c95D6b57D2410C016bC2b8`\n8. `0x842a5a1d456f399EA2fc37BDb77853c4Df1708fa`\n9. `0xBC7070bC34ab83f15Fda79CDA0c90a30F352EeA6`\n10. `0x205ae98cD205b64eC0840D93D80e32114a75F793`\n11. `0x0FA036c6476e16d68a664c0E2DA2BE7e85Ac29c8`\n12. `0x068df9A153948B4be0d4dcC074c3a44ba787b26c`\n13. `0x1534e3D0f23D91142424A0091aab8037fac80CB8`\n14. `0x0b133268a8cfe434B3A6D55a5112c9aE25f3bF13`\n\n## Specifications\n### Actions\nThis proposal will execute the following actions on mainnet:\n1. Grant COMMANDER_ROLE to Fleet Commander for each Ark\n2. Add each Ark to the Fleet Commander\n\n### Cross-chain Mechanism\nThis proposal uses LayerZero to execute governance actions across chains.\n\n## References\nDiscourse: https://forum.summer.fi/t/sip2-24-update-arks-from-core-protocols-on-mainnet-fleets-usdc-weth-usdt/330\n",
